- Levels: NONE / NOTICE(一声短鸣) / WARNING(三声短鸣，每10秒重复) / **EMERGENCY(高低交替警报音，每 5 秒重复)** ✓
- `alarm_trigger(level, reason, text)`: non-blocking (lock + post a semaphore to its worker thread) ✓✓ — so calling it from the gate thread is safe and immediate ✓.
- `alarm_clear()` → stops it ✓.
